        "tab_1": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "title": "PRODUCT DESCRIPTION",
            "use_description": false,
            "content": "<p>Raw Coffee+ is low-caffeine 100% Arabica blended with Lion's Mane and creatine, plus L-Theanine and Taurine for calm, steady energy, L-Tyrosine for motivation, Bacopa and Ginkgo for memory and alertness, and Holy Basil to help you handle stress. You keep the taste and ritual of real coffee, and the energy builds gently and stays. 30 servings per bag.</p>"
          }
        },
        "tab_2": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "title": "WHY RAW COFFEE+",
            "use_description": false,
            "content": "<p>Regular coffee lifts you fast and drops you just as fast. Raw Coffee+ has about 23 mg of caffeine per serving — roughly a quarter of a regular coffee — plus L-Theanine and adaptogens, so your energy stays smooth from morning to evening.</p>"
          }
        },
        "tab_3": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "title": "INGREDIENTS",
            "use_description": false,
            "content": "<p>Creatine Monohydrate 3,000 mg · 100% Arabica Coffee, decaffeinated 2,300 mg · Lion's Mane Extract 10:1 1,000 mg · Taurine 200 mg · L-Theanine 100 mg · L-Tyrosine 100 mg · Holy Basil Extract 100 mg · Bacopa Monnieri 100 mg · Ginkgo Biloba Extract 100 mg. No added sugar, no fillers, no proprietary blends.</p>"
          }
        },
        "tab_4": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "title": "BENEFITS",
            "use_description": false,
            "content": "<p>Steady energy: low caffeine plus 3,000 mg of creatine, L-Theanine and Taurine give you smooth energy that lasts all day, with no jitters and no 3 p.m. crash. Sharper focus: 1,000 mg of Lion's Mane, L-Tyrosine, Bacopa and Ginkgo support concentration, motivation and memory. Less stress: Holy Basil and L-Theanine help you stay calm and clear-headed when the day gets busy. A happier gut: low-caffeine Arabica with no added sugar or fillers is gentler on your stomach than regular coffee.</p>"
          }
        },
        "tab_5": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "title": "SHIPPING, RETURNS & GUARANTEE",
            "use_description": false,
            "content": "<p>✓  Free US shipping</p><p>✓  60-day money-back guarantee</p><p>✓  Secure checkout</p>"
          }
        },
        "tab_6": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "title": "HOW TO USE",
            "use_description": false,
            "content": "<p>Add one scoop (7 g) to 8–12 oz of hot water or milk and stir for 15 seconds. Prefer it iced? Dissolve it in a splash of hot water, then add ice and oat milk. One cup a day, best in the morning.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
